window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My secret's out.</b></p> <p>At least to the three men to whom it matters most.</p> <p>The Bryce Pack</p> <p>Austin, Seth, and Cameron.</p> <p>They say I'm theirs. My body agrees, but I refuse to let my omega biology dictate my life. As soon as I can get my hands on those suppressants, the Bryce Packs omega mate will disappear, and Dylan the beta will get back to regularly scheduled programming.</p> <p>We have a conspiracy to dismantle and missing girls to find, after all.</p> <p>But the boys refuse to give me up as they inch their way slowly but surely into my life. They're making it all but impossible not to fall for them a little bit more every single day.</p> <p>The problem? These boys need to understand one thing.</p> <p>I'm Dylan St. James, and I belong to nobody but me.</p> <p><i>This is a M/M/F/M Omegaverse romance. It is Book 2 in a duology and completes Dylan's story. As always with my books, this is for listeners age 18+ and contains a ton of foul language, steamy scenes, and violent themes. Happy reading!</i></p>"; 
